  "brief": {
    "zh": "把东岸钟楼里的雾钟送到东南码头。西北坡的钥匙能开钟箱。北栈桥每逢三的倍数回合亮起脉冲线。西岸踏板能放下南浮桥。限 74 回合。",
    "en": "Deliver the fog bell from the east tower to the southeast dock. The key on the northwest slope fits the bell chest. A pulse crosses the north pier every third turn. The west-bank plate lowers the south bridge. Finish within 74 turns."
  },
